::PC_U06_L01_Q_Q01::
Question ID: PC_U06_L01_Q_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.PC.SEQ.1
Question:
An arithmetic sequence has first term 4 and common difference 3. Which expression gives a_n
{
=A. 4+3(n-1)#Correct. This answer follows the lesson concept and connects the result to the stated standard.
~B. 4(3)²#This choice uses a related idea but does not complete the required reasoning for the stated standard.
~C. 3+4(n-1)#This choice reflects a common misconception or an incomplete step.
~D. 4+3n#This choice does not match the conditions in the question.
}

